。","kr":"서커스단 단장을 도와 공연 도구를 정리하자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"寻回逃跑的蜥蜴","en":"Find the Lizard","jp":"逃げたトカゲを連れ戻す","kr":"도망간 도마뱀 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"杂技团的蜥蜴逃跑了，赶快帮忙找回它。","en":"One of the troupe's lizards has escaped. Help get it back.","jp":"サーカス団のトカゲが逃げてしまったので、急いで連れ戻すのを手伝ってあげよう。","kr":"서커스단의 도마뱀이 도망쳤다. 도마뱀 찾는 걸 도와주도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"进行枪法表演","en":"Marksmanship Show","jp":"ショットショーを披露する","kr":"사격 공연 진행하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"顶替临时生病的演员，进行枪法表演。","en":"Step in for the sick artist and perform the marksmanship show.","jp":"急に具合が悪くなった団員の代役として、ショットショーを披露しよう。","kr":"아픈 배우를 대신해 사격 공연을 하도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"与杂技团团长对话","en":"Talk to Leader","jp":"サーカス団長と話す","kr":"서커스단 단장과 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"杂技团的演出顺利结束，问问团长还有没有其他需要帮助的事吧。","en":"The show concludes without a hitch. Ask the troupe leader if there's anything else you can help.","jp":"サーカス団の公演が無事に終了したので、手伝えることがないか団長に聞いてみよう。","kr":"서커스단의 공연이 무사히 끝났다. 서커스단 단장에게 다른 도움이 필요하진 않은지 물어보도록 하자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"11225260","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11225260","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11225260.asset","raw_sha256":"3e85ce9407ff7ae029f20380c1e18e9e3b5cb03c4f6c028186f2b9dc35c332e7","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6077368,"size":1608,"identity":"11010515:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"11225270","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11225270","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11225270.asset","raw_sha256":"4f9db6c0118a83a19d3e0d2fe54233ac0ea80b01faa4b807083fe966d4d27648","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6078976,"size":1464,"identity":"11010515:1:2","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"11225280",